# Contact form endpoint.
#
# Optional. Left empty, the form at /contact sends through FormSubmit to the
# email address in data/contact.ts (activate it once from FormSubmit's email).
# Set this to use a different service instead, e.g. Formspree:
#
# To get a URL (free, no server to run):
#   1. Sign up at https://formspree.io with kinematicroboticslabs@gmail.com
#   2. Create a form; it gives you an endpoint like https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
#   3. Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste the endpoint below
#   4. Restart `npm run dev`
#
# Submissions then arrive in that inbox. The value is public by design (it ships
# in the client bundle), which is why it is an endpoint and not a secret key.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
